-----------5.Increment and Decrement Operators--------------
Used to increase or decrease a value by 1.
Operator	         Meaning
++	                 Increment by 1
--	                 Decrement by 1
-------------------code---------------

int a = 10;
a++;
System.out.println(a); // 11

a--;
System.out.println(a); // 10


------Pre-increment vs Post-increment-----
int a = 10;
System.out.println(++a); // 11

int b = 10;
System.out.println(b++); // 10





